    {"claim_id": "gc-citation-01", "claim_text": "ref 是本次回答内的短引用编号，chunk_id 是数据库中的稳定证据主键，二者职责不同。", "claim_type": "factual", "verdict": "supported", "knowledge_point_id": "citation", "source_document_id": "module_context_citation_grounding", "evidence_ids": ["ev-mod05-sec9"]},
    {"claim_id": "gc-citation-02", "claim_text": "引用准确率与答案正确率不同，答案可能正确却引用错误。", "claim_type": "factual", "verdict": "supported", "knowledge_point_id": "citation", "source_document_id": "module_context_citation_grounding", "evidence_ids": ["ev-mod05-sec4"]},
    {"claim_id": "gc-citation-03", "claim_text": "前端显示引用编号时必须能通过 chunk_id 打开原始片段，并继续看到文档、版本和来源。", "claim_type": "factual", "verdict": "supported", "knowledge_point_id": "citation", "source_document_id": "module_context_citation_grounding", "evidence_ids": ["ev-mod05-sec9"]},
    {"claim_id": "gc-citation-04", "claim_text": "证据冲突时应并列展示来源、版本和差异，不能随机选择一条。", "claim_type": "factual", "verdict": "supported", "knowledge_point_id": "citation", "source_document_id": "module_context_citation_grounding", "evidence_ids": ["ev-mod05-sec5"]},
    {"claim_id": "gc-citation-05", "claim_text": "证据不足时应明确返回当前知识库没有足够证据确认，不能用模型记忆补成确定结论。", "claim_type": "factual", "verdict": "supported", "knowledge_point_id": "citation", "source_document_id": "module_context_citation_grounding", "evidence_ids": ["ev-mod05-sec5"]},

    {"claim_id": "gc-hybrid-01", "claim_text": "向量检索擅长同义表达但可能忽略精确编号与错误码，关键词检索擅长字面匹配却难以处理同义词。", "claim_type": "factual", "verdict": "supported", "knowledge_point_id": "hybrid_retrieval", "source_document_id": "module_hybrid_rerank", "evidence_ids": ["ev-mod04-sec1"]},
    {"claim_id": "gc-hybrid-02", "claim_text": "Reciprocal Rank Fusion 使用各路排名的倒数进行融合，不要求不同检索器的裸分数处于同一量纲。", "claim_type": "factual", "verdict": "supported", "knowledge_point_id": "hybrid_retrieval", "source_document_id": "module_hybrid_rerank", "evidence_ids": ["ev-mod04-sec4"]},
    {"claim_id": "gc-hybrid-03", "claim_text": "HyDE 生成的假设文档只能用于产生检索向量，不能作为最终证据或进入引用列表。", "claim_type": "factual", "verdict": "supported", "knowledge_point_id": "hybrid_retrieval", "source_document_id": "module_hybrid_rerank", "evidence_ids": ["ev-mod04-sec3"]},
    {"claim_id": "gc-hybrid-04", "claim_text": "查询改写必须保留原始问题，每条候选要记录由哪个查询召回。", "claim_type": "factual", "verdict": "supported", "knowledge_point_id": "hybrid_retrieval", "source_document_id": "module_hybrid_rerank", "evidence_ids": ["ev-mod04-sec2"]},
    {"claim_id": "gc-hybrid-05", "claim_text": "查询改写应默认保护数字、版本号、错误码、专有名词、路径、否定词和比较关系。", "claim_type": "factual", "verdict": "supported", "knowledge_point_id": "hybrid_retrieval", "source_document_id": "module_hybrid_rerank", "evidence_ids": ["ev-mod04-sec10"]},
    {"claim_id": "gc-hybrid-06", "claim_text": "RRF 把不同检索器的原始分数直接相加，因此不需要归一化。", "claim_type": "factual", "verdict": "contradicted", "knowledge_point_id": "hybrid_retrieval", "source_document_id": "module_context_citation_grounding", "evidence_ids": ["ev-mod05-sec11"]},

    {"claim_id": "gc-rerank-01", "claim_text": "Cross-Encoder 同时读取查询和每条候选文本，在 token 间做联合注意力，相关性判断比双编码器更精细。", "claim_type": "factual", "verdict": "supported", "knowledge_point_id": "rerank", "source_document_id": "module_hybrid_rerank", "evidence_ids": ["ev-mod04-sec5"]},
    {"claim_id": "gc-rerank-02", "claim_text": "Cross-Encoder 对每个查询-文档对都要推理，无法像文档向量那样完全预计算。", "claim_type": "factual", "verdict": "supported", "knowledge_point_id": "rerank", "source_document_id": "module_hybrid_rerank", "evidence_ids": ["ev-mod04-sec5"]},
    {"claim_id": "gc-rerank-03", "claim_text": "两阶段检索流程先用稀疏或双编码器取得几十到上百条候选，再用 Cross-Encoder 重排保留少量最终证据。", "claim_type": "factual", "verdict": "supported", "knowledge_point_id": "rerank", "source_document_id": "module_hybrid_rerank", "evidence_ids": ["ev-mod04-sec5"]},
    {"claim_id": "gc-rerank-04", "claim_text": "重排前应保留召回分数和来源，重排后增加新字段，不能覆盖原始排名。", "claim_type": "factual", "verdict": "supported", "knowledge_point_id": "rerank", "source_document_id": "module_hybrid_rerank", "evidence_ids": ["ev-mod04-sec12"]},
    {"claim_id": "gc-rerank-05", "claim_text": "召回候选 K 太小时重排器看不到正确文档，加 Rerank 后 Recall 反而可能降低。", "claim_type": "factual", "verdict": "supported", "knowledge_point_id": "rerank", "source_document_id": "module_hybrid_rerank", "evidence_ids": ["ev-mod04-sec14"]},

